IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CACHEGEN-STREAM.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-ELEMENTS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BIT-WIDTH           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 COMPRESSED-BYTES    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100 PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CACHEGEN.
    IF NUM-ELEMENTS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF BIT-WIDTH < 2
        MOVE 4 TO BIT-WIDTH.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE COMPRESSED-BYTES = (NUM-ELEMENTS * BIT-WIDTH + 7) / 8.
    COMPUTE COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100 = (NUM-ELEMENTS * 4 * 100) / COMPRESSED-BYTES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 COMPRESSION-RATIO-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 COMPRESSED-BYTES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 20.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
